Package: netcomm
Type: Package
Title: Network Communication Models and Null Models for Connectome-Constrained Brain Maps
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Package", "Maintainer", email = "maintainer@example.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Communication models on weighted structural connectomes (shortest-path
    efficiency, weighted communicability, search information, greedy navigation,
    diffusion efficiency, distance kernel), network-weighted prediction of nodal maps,
    and null models (spin permutations with Hungarian reassignment, degree- and
    geometry-preserving rewiring, variogram-matched and Moran spectral surrogates).
    Written to be merged into the connectomeR package as R/communication.R (0.3.0).
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: Rcpp, expm, clue, stats
LinkingTo: Rcpp
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
